  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "「『下校中の手荷物検査』作戦は、残念ながら失敗したけど！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 11,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "「めげないのが、前向きなのがあたしの魅力♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "「今度こそ、成功させるわよ～！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "「『生徒会長再任選挙』のドタバタのせいで、みんなあんまり勉強できてないこの時期がチャンス！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "「あたしが定期考査で学年首位を勝ち取る、最大の好機なのよ……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 11,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "「受験のこととか考えると、定期考査で学年首位をとる……という実績の価値は計りしれないわ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 11,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "「教師のおぼえもめでたくなって、今後いろいろ動きやすくなるしね～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "「ママも、きっと誉めてくれる！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "「そうよ、学生の本分は勉強よ！　定期考査は戦争よ、あたしはそれに勝利するのよ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "「勝つためなら、どんな汚い手段だって用いてやるわ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "「勝者が歴史をつくるのよっ、勝ったもん勝ちなのよ～☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 11,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "「とはいえ。あたしも、『生徒会長再任選挙』のせいで勉強できてないのは同じ……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 11,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "「もちろん、慌てて必死に勉強したけど。確実に勝利を掴むためには、もう一押しが必要よ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "「他人を蹴落とすための、巧妙な策を打つべきだわ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "「うちの学校、そんな勉強にガツガツしてるやつはいないし。もともと、対抗馬はすくないしね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "「いつも成績のいい神樹とか、四方とかは、それこそ『生徒会長再任選挙』の中心だったわけで。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "「あたしよりずっと、勉強してる暇はなかったはずだし？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "「もちろん陛下も、それは同じ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "「いくら完璧超人といえど、今回ばかりは成績を落とさざるを得ないはずだわ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 11,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "「さくらさんも、試験前に眼鏡を隠してやれば点数とれないでしょ……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "「ふっふっふ♪　ごめんね、さくらさん！　あたしのために犠牲になってねっ☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 11,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "「国語とか英語とかは毎回トップの峰山も、文系科目以外はからっきし興味ないみたいだし。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "「総合点なら、あたしが勝てるはず」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "「花丘も、成績優秀だけど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "「勝ちは他の子に譲る感じで、自分はあんまり『いちばん』にならないしね～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 11,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "「あと怖いのは、天宮ね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 11,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "「まぁどうせ、あの天才児は学校にこないだろうし。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "「テストを受けないだろうから、考慮する必要はないはずだわ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 11,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "「やっぱり最大の敵は、久坂よ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 11,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "「あいつも『生徒会長再任選挙』の中心人物だったはずなのに、もともとの成績がよすぎるのよっ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 11,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "「あたしが、確実に勝てる保証はないわ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "「だからこそ！　手荷物検査で難癖つけて、停学にでもして……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "「テスト期間のうち何日かだけでも、登校できなくする作戦だったのに！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 11,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "「でも、なかなか手強いわね。うまく、かわされちゃったわ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 11,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "「どうしようかしら、今度は登校中に手荷物検査してみる？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "「また、あいつの鞄を調べるふりをして、こっそり宝石をいれて……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
